WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,140 --> 00:00:12,670
Nurse, how is my mother now? What's wrong with you?

2
00:00:13,230 --> 00:00:16,030
The patient just died

3
00:00:16,310 --> 00:00:25,830
What to say

4
00:00:26,070 --> 00:00:27,190
The patient just died

5
00:00:27,350 --> 00:00:28,830
The doctor has done his best to save him

6
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,950
But he still died

7
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:41,700
A group protects the scene

8
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:43,180
Notify medical staff to check the occupants of the vehicle

9
00:00:43,340 --> 00:00:44,460
The second group defends the outer exit

10
00:00:44,580 --> 00:00:46,700
Keep the emergency exit open. Three groups follow me in.

11
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,340
Where do other people’s hearts come from?

12
00:00:48,740 --> 00:00:51,190
Still. Still in the emergency room.

13
00:00:51,630 --> 00:00:59,720
Stop. If you run again, I will shoot you. Hurry up and chase me. Remember.

14
00:00:59,840 --> 00:01:01,240
Don't shoot unless absolutely necessary

15
00:01:02,080 --> 00:01:04,000
There was no weapon on the suspect and he was captured alive.

16
00:01:29,770 --> 00:01:30,970
His injuries are too severe

17
00:01:31,250 --> 00:01:32,690
Even before the surgery

18
00:01:33,010 --> 00:01:34,370
we have tried our best
